## 8. Failure playbook

### LLM provider

- Symptom: 429, 5xx, or timeout errors from model calls
- Where it's used: src/app/api/chat/route.ts:12, src/app/api/chat/route.ts:13, src/app/api/chat/route.ts:14, src/app/api/chat/route.ts:15
- First check: Check provider status and Vercel function logs for the listed routes.
- Mitigation: If the model ID comes from an environment variable, update it and redeploy; otherwise change the listed call sites.
- Status page: https://status.claude.com/, https://status.openai.com/, https://www.vercel-status.com/


